            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "122. If the Employer fails to observe any of the above-prescribed time limits, the Union may appeal the issue to the next level in this process. Should the Union Committee not appeal the job classification determination within the prescribed time limit, the dispute shall be considered settled. Time limits specified herein may be extended by mutual agreement.",
